{"id": "sfo-kone-escalator-billing-credit", "title": "SFO identified $1.36 million in escalator maintenance overbilling", "seconds": 41.5, "voice": "elevenlabs:OtHu0lbpdNTqJVqaxDtR", "narrator": "Maven", "made": "2026-11-25", "key": "10e7618f25d6baf6", "words": 126, "beats": [{"scene": "open", "kind": "hook", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "An Airport contract amendment cut monthly preventive maintenance prices for escalators and moving walkways.", "t0": 0.2, "t1": 5.24, "shot": "r0", "visual": {"type": "hook", "words": ["Which", "rate", "was", "on", "the", "invoice?"], "sub": "Airport escalator maintenance"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.14, 0.52, 0.96, 1.37, 1.7, 2.1, 2.52, 2.9, 3.33, 3.5, 4.03, 4.13, 4.4]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "In 2021 the agreed reduction was twelve percent.", "t0": 5.36, "t1": 8.37, "shot": "r1", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "12%", "label": "Monthly preventive maintenance price reduction"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.12, 0.39, 1.13, 1.3, 1.58, 2.08, 2.23, 2.51]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "The amendment listed new unit prices for four equipment classes.", "t0": 8.49, "t1": 11.42, "shot": "r2", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "rates", "kicker": "San Francisco Airport Commission", "text": "Four equipment classes", "mark": "Four equipment classes"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.1, 0.51, 0.85, 1.02, 1.23, 1.66, 1.81, 2.0, 2.36]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "The Budget and Legislative Analyst examined a proposed 14 million dollar contract increase.", "t0": 11.54, "t1": 16.06, "shot": "r3", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "review", "kicker": "San Francisco Budget and Legislative Analyst", "text": "Proposed increase", "mark": "Proposed increase"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.11, 0.43, 0.55, 1.08, 1.5, 1.92, 1.99, 2.46, 2.93, 3.18, 3.43, 3.88]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "Airport staff found billing errors. The analyst reported that KONE had missed the rate reduction.", "t0": 16.18, "t1": 21.02, "shot": "r4", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "Invoice review"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.39, 0.68, 0.9, 1.22, 2.1, 2.29, 2.66, 3.06, 3.23, 3.59, 3.74, 3.96, 4.07, 4.26]}, {"scene": "credit", "kind": "record", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "The contract exhibit shows the credit against preventive maintenance.", "t0": 21.24, "t1": 24.18, "shot": "r5", "visual": {"type": "record", "layout": "amounts", "context": "Airport contract exhibit", "heading": "Preventive maintenance", "source": "contract", "rows": [{"icon": "file", "label": "Before credit", "value": "$17,113,600"}, {"icon": "file", "label": "After credit", "value": "$15,756,932"}]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.09, 0.48, 0.88, 1.14, 1.25, 1.56, 1.87, 2.33]}, {"scene": "credit", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "The credit was 1,356,668 dollars.", "t0": 24.3, "t1": 26.43, "shot": "r6", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$1,356,668", "label": "Billing credit"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.1, 0.38, 0.49, 0.72, 0.9, 1.16, 1.36, 1.62]}, {"scene": "credit", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "The exhibit kept the separate as-needed services line unchanged.", "t0": 26.55, "t1": 29.75, "shot": "r7", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "As-needed services"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.1, 0.51, 0.73, 0.85, 1.23, 1.74, 2.22, 2.48]}, {"scene": "credit", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[3]", "established[3]"], "text": "The Board voted in April 2024 to authorize a lower increase.", "t0": 29.87, "t1": 33.86, "shot": "r8", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "board", "kicker": "San Francisco Board of Supervisors", "text": "April 23, 2024", "mark": "April 23, 2024"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.1, 0.38, 0.73, 0.86, 1.29, 1.63, 2.35, 2.55, 3.04, 3.11, 3.41]}, {"scene": "credit", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[3]", "established[3]"], "text": "The Board set the revised contract ceiling shown here.", "t0": 33.98, "t1": 36.28, "shot": "r9", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$42,780,241", "label": "Revised contract ceiling"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.1, 0.39, 0.58, 0.69, 1.08, 1.52, 1.83, 2.04]}, {"scene": "credit", "kind": "unknowns", "ref": ["notEstablished[0]"], "text": "The credit does not establish a cash refund.", "t0": 36.4, "t1": 38.3, "shot": "r10", "visual": {"type": "unknowns", "cards": ["Cash refund", "Final payments"]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.09, 0.35, 0.5, 0.67, 1.06, 1.12, 1.39]}, {"scene": "credit", "kind": "end", "ref": ["status"], "text": "Every source is linked in the case file below.", "t0": 38.42, "t1": 40.56, "shot": "r11", "visual": {"type": "end"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.31, 0.65, 0.8, 1.06, 1.17, 1.26, 1.5, 1.76]}], "format": 6, "chapters": {"open": "The signed rates", "credit": "How the accounts changed"}, "look": "flow", "hook": "number"}